    "headline_insight": {
      "as_of": "2026-06-26T10:24:42.588654+00:00",
      "insight": "Click volume concentrates at both ends of the accountability chain — the perpetrator (North Korea/Lazarus attribution) and the institutional response (SAFE Crypto Act, arrests, sentences) — revealing that readers have stopped treating social engineering as a personal-hygiene problem and now track it as a geopolitical and regulatory fault line.",
